# Chez Kura — Project Rules for AI Assistants

You are working on the storefront for **Chez Kura**, a made-to-order home decor
brand. Read these rules before changing anything.

## What the brand is about

Chez Kura exists for ONE feeling: walking into a home and feeling instantly at
peace. It is about the home first. Pets are included because a pet is part of
what makes a house feel like home — not because this is a "pet store."

## Hard rules — do not break these

1. **NEVER mention AI, machine learning, generative art, or algorithms anywhere
   a customer can see.** Not in copy, alt text, meta tags, or comments that ship.
   Designs are described as "made only for your space", "made to order",
   "never repeated". The production method is not the story.
2. **Home comes first, pets come second.** In navigation, on the homepage, and in
   collections. The pet section lives BELOW home accessories, in a visually
   quieter treatment (smaller section, no competing hero). Present, not hidden.
3. **Voice: warm, calm, slightly poetic. Never salesy.** Short sentences. No
   exclamation marks. No "SHOP NOW!!!", no urgency timers, no fake scarcity.
4. **Made-to-order items are final sale.** Any returns/policy copy must reflect
   this. Do not write a generic 30-day-returns policy.
5. Keep the palette. Do not introduce new brand colors.

## Palette (CSS custom properties in assets/styles.css)

| Role | Hex | Variable |
|---|---|---|
| Background / surface | `#F6F1EA` | `--bone` |
| Secondary neutral | `#E3D5C3` | `--sand` |
| Primary accent (Home) | `#C17A56` | `--terracotta` |
| Secondary accent (Pets) | `#93A084` | `--sage` |
| Ink / text | `#2B2723` | `--charcoal` |

Home sections use terracotta accents. Pet sections use sage accents. This is how
the two collections stay visually distinct inside one brand.

## Typography

- Headings + wordmark: geometric sans (Futura / Poppins / Neue Montreal).
  Wide letter-spacing on the wordmark and eyebrow labels only.
- Body: humanist sans (Inter / Work Sans).

## Products and prices (source of truth: shopify/products.csv)

Home Accessories:
- Cushion covers 18x18 — $49.99
- Wall art, small canvas 16x16 — $69.99
- Wall art, large canvas 24x36 — $129.99
- Rugs / accent mats — $59.99

Pets (require a customer photo upload; longer lead time):
- Pet portrait canvas 16x16 — $79.99
- Pet name blanket 50x60 — $89.99
- Pet photo mat — $59.99

Bundles:
- The Pair (2 cushions, 15% off) — $84.98
- Complete the Room (cushion + rug, 12% off) — $96.78
- For You and Them (home piece + pet portrait, 12% off) — $114.38

Free shipping over $90.

## Tech notes

- Static HTML/CSS. No build step, no framework, no dependencies.
- This prototype is the visual reference for a Shopify theme. When porting to
  Shopify, translate sections into theme sections/blocks; keep the same order.
- Product images are currently CSS gradient placeholders (`.t1`–`.t6`). Replace
  them with real Printful mockups when artwork exists.
